[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the rod (1a) from the lock (1b) and save it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018965.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the link is undamaged.</p><p>1. Replace the rod retaining bush.</p><p>2. Connect the rod (2a) to the lock (2b).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018966.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Check that the linkage and\ndoor lock/unlock are working.</p>"]]